<3 Problem 2 - Tax Calculator

income :=) -0-0-

rate :=) 0

<3 Determine tax rate based on income brackets
:) (income :<) 10000.0) ><(((,^>
    rate :=) 0
<^,)))><
:| (income :<) 40000.0) ><(((,^>
    rate :=) 10
<^,)))><
:| (income :<) 80000.0) ><(((,^>
    rate :=) 20
<^,)))><
:( ><(((,^>
    rate :=) 30
<^,)))><

<3 Calculate tax and net income
tax :=) (rate :/) 100.0) :*) income
net :=) income :-) tax

<3 Output results
:P("income =")
:P(income)
:P("rate =")
:P(rate)
:P("tax =")
:P(tax)
:P("net =")
:P(net)
